WEBVTT

00:01:28.916 --> 00:01:31.476
which you may also know of as natural gas.

00:01:31.476 --> 00:01:33.436
It’s 17 percent of the total.

00:01:34.236 --> 00:01:35.836
There are other greenhouse gases,

00:01:35.836 --> 00:01:38.836
but these three make up the bulk
of the climate challenge.

00:01:39.276 --> 00:01:40.756
All must be reduced --

00:01:40.756 --> 00:01:41.756
and fast.

00:01:42.516 --> 00:01:44.636
Methane is better
at trapping the Sun’s heat,

00:01:44.636 --> 00:01:48.956
which means cutting methane pollution 
is a necessary and fast-acting stimulus

00:01:48.956 --> 00:01:50.156
for our carbon budget.

00:01:50.836 --> 00:01:52.676
If methane emissions from agriculture

00:01:52.676 --> 00:01:55.156
and the oil and gas industry
can be eliminated

00:01:55.156 --> 00:01:56.396
in this decade,

00:01:56.396 --> 00:01:58.476
we might be able to stave off catastrophes

00:01:58.476 --> 00:02:02.036
like the loss of the Arctic sea ice
and glaciers all around the world.